No. 8.9
% Liu Hui's commentary on Problem 9, Sibu congkan p. 18 (and repeated in Dai Zhen's 訂訛, p. 42).
% Unit: 兩.
Things 雀 燕 重
"此四雀一燕與一雀五燕衡適平并重一斤故各八兩"
Set right  4 1 8      "列兩行程數"
Set left   1 5 8
% 左行頭位其數是一可省乘: the left head is 1, so the right column need not be multiplied.
Multiply left by the head of right.                "令右行徧乘左行"
Take right from left until the head is gone.       "而取其法實於左左行數多以右行取其數左頭位減盡"
% He names the 法 and 實 left in the left column (中法下實) but gives no figure for them.
Solve.                                             "中法下實卽每枚當重宜可知也"
Answer 1 13/19, 1 5/19

% His other way (按…): the board set again as he lists it, the two pans compared.
"按此四雀一燕與一雀五燕其重等"
Set right  4 1 8
Set left   1 5 8
Take left from right.
Gives right 3 -4 0                                 "是三雀四燕重相當"
"雀率重四燕率重三也諸再程之率皆可異術求之卽其數也"
% 雀率重四燕率重三 (the rates of weight, sparrow 4 to swallow 3) are not a column of the board, and `Rates`
% checks only the 法 and 實s of a board solved through a 法: kept as a quoted line, not checked.
